# Deep2 Qwen32 85TPS — Batch 3/5, item 31
# Base: 40TPS Batches 1-4 + 85TPS Batches 1-2
#
# Adds a no-extra-model self-speculative drafter:
#   token0 = exact current Qwen target argmax
#   token1..N = shallow first-D-layer Qwen predictions
#
# Draft future KV is written transactionally and always rolled back before the
# full target verifier runs. Therefore draft errors cannot corrupt target state.
#
# Env:
#   DEEP2_SELF_DRAFT_LAYERS=8   (default 8, clamped 1..numLayers-1)
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0031_shallow_self_speculative_drafter.patch

